### === COMMENTS (via book-client-service on port 8081) ===

### Get comments for book
GET http://localhost:8081/api/books/1/comments

### Get comment by id
GET http://localhost:8081/api/comments/1

### Create comment for book
POST http://localhost:8081/api/books/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Great book (via client)!"
}

### Update comment
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/comments/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Updated comment via client"
}

### Delete comment
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/comments/1

### === CIRCUIT BREAKER MONITORING ===

### Check circuit breaker health
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health

### View circuit breaker state
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/circuitbreakers

### View circuit breaker events
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/circuitbreakerevents
